# Marketing review notes

**Sources:** `marketing/launch-copy.md` vs `product/spec.md`

## Unsupported claims

| Claim in copy | Spec line that contradicts it |
|---|---|
| "Works offline, anywhere." | `- Offline support: removed in this release.` |
| "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel in one click." | `- Export: CSV only.` |

## Summary

- **Offline support** — the copy claims the product works offline; the spec explicitly states it was removed this release. Unsupported.
- **PDF and Excel export** — the copy lists PDF and Excel as export targets; the spec states only CSV is supported. Unsupported.
